n it happens)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDosageInstructions.dosageDetails.duration.durationUnit</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction.timing.repeat.durationUnit (s | min | h | d | wk | mo | a - unit of time (UCUM))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDosageInstructions.dosageDetails.duration.durationMax</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction.timing.repeat.durationMax (How long when it happens (Max))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDosageInstructions.dosageDetails.eventTime</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction.timing.repeat (When the event is to occur)</td><td>Regroupement porté par les éléments détaillés eventTimeCode et offset.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMDosageInstructions.dosageDetails.eventTime.eventTimeCode</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction.timing.repeat.when (Code for time period of occurrence)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDosageInstructions.dosageDetails.eventTime.offset</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction.timing.repeat.offset (Minutes from event (before or after))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDosageInstructions.dosageDetails.eventEndSequence</td><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMDosageInstructions.dosageDetails.bodySite